  "created": 1755007957961,
  "description": "This automation handles the processing that needs to be done when a CT is created via all 3 methods: Jira Forms, Jira Actions (automation), and Jira Create.\n\n1. Splits the \"Product Name(s)\" comma-separated value in the Jira Form or CT Creation Automation Action, validates if each is a valid Part EID in the Part Number Assets, and adds each valid Part Number to the \"Part Numbers\" Assets Object field. \n2. Sync'ing Updating \"Part Maturity\" based on the selected \"Part Numbers\". \n3. Setting status and assignee if \"Part Maturity\" is Tooled or Production.",
